sangati dampati

  "shiva-shakti-abheda samsarga-swarupa ananda-sthita"
  "tvam-abheda rati-yukta mithuna-siddha"
  "prema-samsarga-phala zha-yukta moksha-drishthanta"
  "kama-janya bhava-sthita ishvara-drishthanta"

  shabda shiva-shakti, tvam, rati, mithuna, samsarga, ananda, prema-samsarga, zha, kama, bhava, moksha, ishvara

done
